    <briefdescription>
<para>Given a set of conditions and a time interval, this solver computes all sub-intervals over which conditions are met. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses a temporal grid with bisection to find switching instants where conditions transition between satisfied and unsatisfied states. The grid step size determines the minimum detectable event window. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
